sue Operations</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Orthopedics</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The orthopedic department treats:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bone fractures</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Joint pain</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Arthritis</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sports injuries</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Knee problems</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Shoulder injuries</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Spine disorders</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Trauma management</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cardiology</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Heart care services generally include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>ECG</li>\n\n\n\n<li>2D Echo</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cardiac Evaluation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hypertension Management</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Heart Disease Screening</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Preventive Cardiology</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gynecology &amp; Obstetrics</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Women\'s healthcare services include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pregnancy care</li>\n\n\n\n<li>High-risk pregnancy management</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Normal delivery</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cesarean delivery</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Infertility consultation</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Menstrual disorder treatment</li>\n\n\n\n<li>PCOS management</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Women\'s wellness programs</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pediatrics</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Child healthcare services include:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Newborn care</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vaccination</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Growth monitoring</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Childhood infections</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pediatric consultations</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nutrition guidance</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Emergency &amp; Trauma Care</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Medical emergenci